{"seq":3,"slug":"counterfeit-clue-submit","title":"假货线索提交与品牌协同","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/brand-registry-ip-enforcement/infringement-report-evidence/counterfeit-clue-submit","wordCount":1817,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"假货线索提交与品牌协同\">假货线索提交与品牌协同</h1><p>假货判定（counterfeit determination）是所有 IP 判定里最难自动化的一种，原因很具体：判定「这件商品是不是仿品」需要的知识，往往只有品牌方自己有——正品的缝线密度、标签字体、批次编码规则、包装材料的厚度、序列号是否落在有效号段内。平台侧的判定员即便有实物在手，也未必能分辨一个做工精良的仿品与正品的差异。</p>\n<p>这让假货治理天然是一个<strong>协同问题</strong>：平台负责发现线索、控制流通、执行下架，品牌方负责提供真伪判定的权威结论。本篇讲这条协同链怎么建——线索如何标准化地提交给品牌方、品牌方的结论如何回填并成为判定的组成部分、以及当品牌方不响应时系统怎么办。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么协同不能是-发邮件问品牌\">核心概念：为什么协同不能是「发邮件问品牌」</h2><p>朴素做法是把被举报的商品信息发给品牌方，等回复。这在少量投诉时能用，规模化后立刻失效：品牌方一天可能收到上千条线索，格式不一、信息不全、无法批量处理；平台无法知道哪条线索被处理了、结论是什么、判定为什么是这个结果。协同必须是一条<strong>有 schema、有状态、有 SLA 的接口</strong>，而不是一个邮箱。</p>\n<h3 id=\"线索的三个必需要素\">线索的三个必需要素</h3><p>一条能被品牌方独立判定的线索，必须包含三样东西：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可比对的实物证据</strong>：至少是高清的商品与包装照片，理想情况是品牌方能拿到实物的购买取证（见 <a href=\"evidence-chain-goodfaith\">证据链与善意声明</a> 中关于 <code>test_purchase</code> 的处理）。</li>\n<li><strong>被质疑的具体点</strong>：不能只说「这是假的」，要说「疑似假的原因」——价格异常、渠道异常、鉴别点不符、序列号查无。有具体质疑点，品牌方的判定才是定向的。</li>\n<li><strong>可回填的定位符</strong>：线索 ID 与商品/链接/批次的稳定标识，让品牌方的结论能精确落到某一条线索上。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;clue_id&quot;: &quot;clue_20260927_8812&quot;,&#10;  &quot;source&quot;: &quot;buyer_report&quot;,&#10;  &quot;target&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;site&quot;: &quot;US&quot;,&#10;    &quot;listing_id&quot;: &quot;B0XXXXXXXX&quot;,&#10;    &quot;seller_party&quot;: 55201,&#10;    &quot;sku_id&quot;: &quot;SKU-9931&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;suspicion&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;signals&quot;: [&quot;price_anomaly&quot;, &quot;serial_not_found&quot;, &quot;label_font_mismatch&quot;],&#10;    &quot;detail&quot;: &quot;序列号 ACME-2026-004417 在品牌官方校验接口返回不存在&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;attachments&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;photo_package&quot;, &quot;evidence_id&quot;: 77120 },&#10;    { &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;photo_label&quot;, &quot;evidence_id&quot;: 77121 }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;requested_verdict&quot;: &quot;authenticity_opinion&quot;,&#10;  &quot;due_at&quot;: &quot;2026-10-04T00:00:00Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"clue_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"clue_20260927_8812\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"buyer_report\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"site\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"listing_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B0XXXXXXXX\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"seller_party\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">55201</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sku_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU-9931\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"suspicion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"signals\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"price_anomaly\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"serial_not_found\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"label_font_mismatch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"detail\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"序列号 ACME-2026-004417 在品牌官方校验接口返回不存在\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"attachments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"photo_package\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"evidence_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">77120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"photo_label\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"evidence_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">77121</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"requested_verdict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"authenticity_opinion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"due_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>signals</code> 是枚举而非自由文本。枚举化让品牌方可以批量筛选（只看含 <code>serial_not_found</code> 的线索），也让平台能统计哪类信号最有效——这直接喂给第 4 章的判定质量度量（见 <a href=\"../ip-enforcement-ops/ip-takedown-sla-quality\">下架 SLA 与判定质量</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"协同的状态机\">协同的状态机</h2><p>线索从生成到闭环是一个明确的状态机，每个状态都有明确的持有方与超时动作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; collected: 平台采集线索&#10;  collected --&gt; submitted: 推送品牌方&#10;  submitted --&gt; acknowledged: 品牌方确认接收&#10;  submitted --&gt; expired: 超时未响应&#10;  acknowledged --&gt; verdict_returned: 品牌方回填结论&#10;  acknowledged --&gt; expired: 超时未回填&#10;  verdict_returned --&gt; confirmed_counterfeit: 结论=仿品&#10;  verdict_returned --&gt; confirmed_genuine: 结论=正品&#10;  verdict_returned --&gt; inconclusive: 结论=无法判定&#10;  expired --&gt; platform_only_review: 平台单方判定&#10;  platform_only_review --&gt; confirmed_counterfeit&#10;  platform_only_review --&gt; closed_no_action&#10;  confirmed_counterfeit --&gt; closed_enforced&#10;  confirmed_genuine --&gt; closed_no_action&#10;  inconclusive --&gt; platform_only_review&#10;  closed_enforced --&gt; [*]&#10;  closed_no_action --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; collected: 平台采集线索\n  collected --&gt; submitted: 推送品牌方\n  submitted --&gt; acknowledged: 品牌方确认接收\n  submitted --&gt; expired: 超时未响应\n  acknowledged --&gt; verdict_returned: 品牌方回填结论\n  acknowledged --&gt; expired: 超时未回填\n  verdict_returned --&gt; confirmed_counterfeit: 结论=仿品\n  verdict_returned --&gt; confirmed_genuine: 结论=正品\n  verdict_returned --&gt; inconclusive: 结论=无法判定\n  expired --&gt; platform_only_review: 平台单方判定\n  platform_only_review --&gt; confirmed_counterfeit\n  platform_only_review --&gt; closed_no_action\n  confirmed_counterfeit --&gt; closed_enforced\n  confirmed_genuine --&gt; closed_no_action\n  inconclusive --&gt; platform_only_review\n  closed_enforced --&gt; [*]\n  closed_no_action --&gt; [*]</pre><p>两个状态转换值得强调。<strong><code>expired</code> 不等于线索作废</strong>：品牌方不响应时，线索转入平台单方判定（<code>platform_only_review</code>），而不是被丢弃——否则品牌方只要不响应就能让自己的假货留在平台上。<strong><code>inconclusive</code> 也要有出路</strong>：品牌方给出「无法判定」时，系统应退回平台侧用可用的信号（价格、渠道、其他投诉模式）做保守判定，而不是把它当成「正品」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"品牌方结论的权重要显式\">品牌方结论的权重要显式</h3><p>品牌方结论回填后，它不是终局判决，而是一个高权重的输入。系统应当把结论与平台自身信号一起进入判定，并把权重关系落成可解释的结构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判定输入</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>权重方向</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>品牌方鉴定为仿品</td>\n<td>品牌方</td>\n<td>强支持下架</td>\n<td>仍保留反通知路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品牌方鉴定为正品</td>\n<td>品牌方</td>\n<td>强支持驳回</td>\n<td>直接的误杀防线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列号校验不通过</td>\n<td>平台/品牌</td>\n<td>支持下架</td>\n<td>需确认校验接口权威性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格显著低于授权渠道</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>弱支持</td>\n<td>单独不足以判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家历史假货判定</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>支持下架</td>\n<td>见重复侵权处置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把权重写成表而不是硬编码在判定函数里，是为了让它可审计、可调参、可解释给申诉方。当卖家申诉「凭什么下架我」时，系统要能给出「因为品牌方鉴定为仿品 + 序列号校验不通过」这样的具体理由，而不是「模型判的」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据模型\">数据模型</h2><p>线索实体与品牌方回填是两条独立的记录，用外键关联。分开的理由是：一条线索可能被多次推送（品牌方 A 不响应、转给品牌方 B 的授权代理），每次推送与回填都应有独立记录。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE counterfeit_clue (&#10;  id               BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  source           VARCHAR(24) NOT NULL,  -- buyer_report|brand_report|&#10;                                          -- platform_detect|partner_feed&#10;  listing_id       VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  seller_party     BIGINT,&#10;  signals          TEXT[] NOT NULL,&#10;  evidence_refs    BIGINT[] NOT NULL,&#10;  state            VARCHAR(24) NOT NULL,  -- collected|submitted|acknowledged|&#10;                                          -- verdict_returned|expired|closed&#10;  created_at       TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  due_at           TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE clue_brand_request (&#10;  id             BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  clue_id        BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES counterfeit_clue(id),&#10;  brand_party    BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  sent_at        TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  acked_at       TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  verdict        VARCHAR(24),             -- counterfeit|genuine|inconclusive&#10;  verdict_note   TEXT,&#10;  verdict_at     TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  sla_breached   BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_clue_state ON counterfeit_clue (state, due_at);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_clue_request_brand ON clue_brand_request (brand_party, verdict);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> counterfeit_clue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id               </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- buyer_report|brand_report|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                                          -- platform_detect|partner_feed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  listing_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  seller_party     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  signals          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_refs    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- collected|submitted|acknowledged|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                                          -- verdict_returned|expired|closed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  due_at           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> clue_brand_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  clue_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counterfeit_clue(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  brand_party    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sent_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  acked_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  verdict        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- counterfeit|genuine|inconclusive</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  verdict_note   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  verdict_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sla_breached   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_clue_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counterfeit_clue (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, due_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_clue_request_brand</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clue_brand_request (brand_party, verdict);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>idx_clue_state</code> 支撑超时扫描任务（找出 <code>state=&#39;submitted&#39; and due_at &lt; now()</code> 的线索转平台判定）；<code>idx_clue_request_brand</code> 支撑品牌方维度的统计——它在第 4 章会被用来衡量「哪些品牌响应慢、哪些响应质量高」，进而决定是否调整该品牌的线索推送策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不响应的协同退化\">不响应的协同退化</h2><p>协同机制最怕的不是拒绝，而是沉默。品牌方长期不响应会让线索积压、判定延迟拉长，最终反映为 SLA 恶化。系统应当有明确的退化策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分级超时</strong>：首次推送给一个响应窗口（例如 7 天），超时后自动升级提醒，再超时转平台单方判定。</li>\n<li><strong>可信度降权</strong>：对响应率长期过低的品牌，其线索的自动下架倾向可以适度上调（因为无法依赖其鉴定），但必须在审计中记录这一调整，避免变成对特定品牌的隐性惩罚。</li>\n<li><strong>不可放弃</strong>：品牌方不响应绝不能导致线索被静默关闭。<code>expired → platform_only_review → closed_*</code> 这条路径保证了每条线索都有一个终态。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"与高信任通道的关系\">与高信任通道的关系</h3><p>响应稳定、鉴定质量高的品牌，可以进入更快的协同通道——线索优先推送、结论优先采信。这与 DSA 的 trusted flagger 概念同构：DSA 允许成员国数字服务协调员向满足「具备识别与通知非法内容的专业能力、独立于平台、勤勉准确地开展工作」条件的实体授予 trusted flagger 地位，平台须对其通知给予优先处理（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/HTML/?uri=CELEX:32022R2065\">DSA Article 22</a>）。区别在于：平台内部的品牌协同通道是商业约定，trusted flagger 是法定地位；但两者的运营逻辑一致——<strong>信任要用可度量的历史表现来换取，而不是用规模或名气来换取。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>假货判定的关键知识往往只存在于品牌方，平台与品牌必须协同而非单方判定。</li>\n<li>协同必须有 schema、有状态、有 SLA，不能是靠邮件往来的非结构化沟通。</li>\n<li>一条可判定线索需要三要素：可比对的实物证据、具体质疑点、可回填的定位符。</li>\n<li>质疑信号应枚举化，便于品牌方批量筛选，也便于平台统计信号有效性。</li>\n<li>品牌方不响应转入平台单方判定，不能静默关闭；「无法判定」也要有保守判定的出路。</li>\n<li>品牌方结论是高权重输入而非终局判决，判定权重应显式成表以便解释给申诉方。</li>\n<li>高信任协同通道（含法定 trusted flagger）的本质是以可度量的历史表现换取优先权。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"假货线索提交与品牌协同","id":"假货线索提交与品牌协同"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么协同不能是「发邮件问品牌」","id":"核心概念-为什么协同不能是-发邮件问品牌"},{"level":3,"text":"线索的三个必需要素","id":"线索的三个必需要素"},{"level":2,"text":"协同的状态机","id":"协同的状态机"},{"level":3,"text":"品牌方结论的权重要显式","id":"品牌方结论的权重要显式"},{"level":2,"text":"数据模型","id":"数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"不响应的协同退化","id":"不响应的协同退化"},{"level":3,"text":"与高信任通道的关系","id":"与高信任通道的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"证据链与善意声明","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/brand-registry-ip-enforcement/infringement-report-evidence/evidence-chain-goodfaith"},"next":{"title":"商品/链接下架执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/brand-registry-ip-enforcement/takedown-counternotice/listing-takedown-link-remove"}}